407">http://www.brunel.ac.uk/news/pressoffice/cdata/peterberesfordnov1407</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="r15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="webpage"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goodwin</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>6</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Peck</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Freeman</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Posaner</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Managing across diverse networks of care: lessons from other sectors. Report to the national co-ordinating centre for NHS Service Delivery and Organisation R&#x00026;D (NCCSDO). NCCSDO; 2004</article-title><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.sdo.nihr.ac.uk/files/adhoc/39-policy-report.pdf">http://www.sdo.nihr.ac.uk/files/adhoc/39-policy-report.pdf</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>